  "plain": "A researcher who goes by UAPGerb told podcast host Jesse Michels in 2026 that he once spoke at length with a man named Dan Howe about something called Project Preserve Destiny, linked to a man named Dan Sherman. According to UAPGerb, Howe said Sherman's account of ELINT, short for electronic intelligence, meaning the gathering of intelligence from electronic signals, was exactly right. The point is that if Sherman knows that world so well, his wider story is more believable."
